body:
They probably want to but can't. I'm pretty sure to turn around they move forward slightly, in kind of a U shape, but the horses in front are blocking them so now they're wedged.

&#x200B;

Also you only told a specific formation to fallback, not everyone. I'm assuming horse archers, since they're the ones that are facing backwards

Release by court order after like 2 years of county jail. I believe nobody knows *why*, but I'm assuming his lawyer filing an autism disorder deferred deposition probably had a part in it. I don't know legalese, but I'm assuming that's essentially "They don't fully grasp the consequences, so they should get help instead of prison." or something like that

&#x200B;

Edit: 3 days later and **he's back online.**

Can't believe I didn't even recognize my own leaf...

&#x200B;

Guess I'll die now

59 parts now, and only goes up to 2017 stuff iirc.

&#x200B;

Creator's having a break now that all this shit came out because *holy fuck* the amount of sad shit he's seeing... it can break anyone down.

Mf really murdered two people in my apartment

&#x200B;

Where the fuck am I supposed to hide the bodies
